---
import { COMPANY_INFO } from '../data/jiyaData';
---

<section id="about" class="about section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row gy-5 align-items-center">

      <!-- Left: Image & Numbering Badge -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 position-relative">
        <div class="position-relative p-3" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 10px; background: #fff;">
          <img 
            src="/images/products/hpt_yellow_550_clean.png" 
            class="img-fluid rounded" 
            alt="About JIYA Sales & Services" 
            style="width: 100%; height: 400px; object-fit: contain; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); background-color: #ffffff;"
          />
          <!-- Numbering / Experience Badge -->
          <div class="position-absolute d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-column" style="bottom: -20px; right: -20px; background: var(--accent-color); color: #fff; padding: 20px 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
            <span style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;">01</span>
            <span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Top Manufacturer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Description -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 content ps-lg-5">
        <div class="section-title text-start mb-4">
          <h2 style="font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-color); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px;">About Us</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-top: 0; line-height: 1.2;">Welcome to {COMPANY_INFO.name}</p>
        </div>
        
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          Established in GIDC Phase 2, Vapi, <strong>{COMPANY_INFO.name}</strong> is a dedicated manufacturer, supplier, and repair specialist for high-performance Material Handling Equipments, Hydraulic Hand Pallet Trucks, Stackers, Heavy-Duty Polyurethane Casters, and OEM Industrial Spares.
        </p>

        <div class="row gy-3 mb-4">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
              <i class="bi bi-gear-fill" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--accent-color); margin-right: 15px;"></i>
              <div>
                <h5 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 4px;">Quality Assured</h5>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 0;">100% Tax compliant (GST: {COMPANY_INFO.gstin}) &amp; OEM grade materials.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
              <i class="bi bi-clock-history" style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--accent-color); margin-right: 15px;"></i>
              <div>
                <h5 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 4px;">Timely Delivery</h5>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 0;">Same-day dispatch for critical spares across Vapi &amp; Gujarat.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Our mission is to empower factories, warehouses, and engineering units with long-lasting mobility and lifting solutions, ensuring minimal downtime and peak material handling efficiency.
        </p>
        
        <a href="/about" class="btn" style="background: var(--accent-color); color: #fff; padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: 0.3s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">
          Read More <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
